 "iconFontName": "circle-dashed", "width": 16.0, "height": 16.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#94A3B8"}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "n19068", "width": 96.0, "height": "fit_content", "content": "公司信息", "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC", "fontSize": 14.0, "fontWeight": 500, "lineHeight": 1.5, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#CBD5E1"}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "n19069", "width": 370.0, "height": "fit_content", "content": "缺 公司类型、行业、主营产品", "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC", "fontSize": 14.0, "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.5, "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#94A3B8"}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "n19070", "width": "fit_content", "height": "fit_content", "content": "去补充", "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC", "fontSize": 13.0, "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.5, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#60A5FA"}]}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "n19071", "width": "fill_container", "height": "fit_content", "layout": "horizontal", "gap": 8.0, "padding": [10.0, 14.0], "alignItems": "center", "cornerRadius": 10.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#2D2434"}], "children": [{"type": "icon_font", "id": "n19072", "iconFontName": "lightbulb", "width": 15.0, "height": 15.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#F87171"}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "n19073", "width": 505.0, "height": "fit_content", "content": "官网、企业邮箱、询盘原文一项都没有，AI 多半只能给出待核实清单。补上任意一项再背调，结果会准很多。", "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC", "fontSize": 13.0, "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.5, "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#CBD5E1"}]}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "n19074", "width": "fill_container", "height": 1.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#1A2436"}], "children": []}, {"type": "frame", "id": "n19075", "width": "fill_container", "height": "fit_content", "layout": "horizontal", "gap": 10.0, "padding": [14.0, 24.0], "justifyContent": "end", "alignItems": "center", "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "n19076", "width": "fit_content", "height": "fit_content", "layout": "horizontal", "padding": [8.0, 18.0], "justifyContent": "center", "alignItems": "center", "cornerRadius": 10.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "transparent"}], "stroke": {"thickness": 1.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#2B3A52"}]}, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "n19077", "width": "fit_content", "height": "fit_content", "content": "先去补充", "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC", "fontSize": 14.0, "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.5, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#F8FAFC"}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "n19078", "width": "fit_content", "height": "fit_content", "layout": "horizontal", "padding": [8.0, 18.0], "justifyContent": "center", "alignItems": "center", "cornerRadius": 10.0, "fill": [{"type": "linear_gradient", "angle": 90.0, "stops": [{"offset": 0.0, "color": "#2563EB"}, {"offset": 1.0, "color": "#4F46E5"}]}], "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "n19079", "width": "fit_content", "height": "fit_content", "content": "仍要背调", "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC", "fontSize": 14.0, "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.5, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#F8FAFC"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "text", "id": "n19080", "width": 620.0, "height": "fit_content", "content": "点「AI 背调」先弹出。关键信息一项都没有时为「很少」，按钮为「仍要背调」，不拦截。gmail 等免费邮箱的后缀找不到公司，算作没有企业邮箱。询盘原文要在询盘管理登记，没有「去补充」。", "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC", "fontSize": 13.0, "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.5, "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#94A3B8"}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "n19081", "name": "P2-背调前检查-信息一般", "x": 820.0, "y": 0.0, "width": 760.0, "height": "fit_content", "layout": "vertical", "gap": 20.0, "padding": [56.0, 70.0], "alignItems": "center", "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#05080F"}], "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "n19082", "width": 620.0, "height": "fit_content", "layout": "vertical", "clipContent": true, "cornerRadius": 18.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#111A2C"}], "stroke": {"thickness": 1.0, "fill": [{"type": "solid", "color": "#2B3A52"}]}, "effects": [{